[{"s":0,"a":3.2,"d":4.87,"text":"kubectl 与声明式 API：看懂每一份 YAML。","f":"14d02fd6e3.mp3","h":"14d02fd6e3","r":10},{"s":1,"a":0.6,"d":4.63,"text":"K8s 里的每样东西，都是一个 API 对象。","f":"936893fddc.mp3","h":"936893fddc","r":0},{"s":1,"a":5.6,"d":4.99,"text":"apiVersion、kind、metadata、spec 由你来写。","f":"8c3db12849.mp3","h":"8c3db12849","r":5},{"s":1,"a":10.8,"d":5.02,"text":"status 由系统填写，控制器让现实追上 spec。","f":"4d32c875b0.mp3","h":"4d32c875b0","r":0},{"s":2,"a":0.6,"d":4.78,"text":"kubectl 只是客户端，把 YAML 变成 HTTP 请求。","f":"800568bd01.mp3","h":"800568bd01","r":22},{"s":2,"a":5.9,"d":5.02,"text":"context 就是：集群 + 用户 + 默认命名空间。","f":"5ae4b5fad4.mp3","h":"5ae4b5fad4","r":0},{"s":2,"a":11.2,"d":4.58,"text":"删东西之前，先确认当前连的是哪个集群。","f":"39c549bc3f.mp3","h":"39c549bc3f","r":0},{"s":3,"a":0.6,"d":4.25,"text":"命令式是“做个动作”，重复 create 就报错。","f":"15933d842b.mp3","h":"15933d842b","r":0},{"s":3,"a":5.6,"d":5.02,"text":"声明式 apply 可以反复执行，结果总与文件一致。","f":"fc32f194d8.mp3","h":"fc32f194d8","r":0},{"s":3,"a":10.8,"d":4.42,"text":"YAML 放进 Git，就成了唯一事实来源。","f":"476553d6b1.mp3","h":"476553d6b1","r":0},{"s":4,"a":0.6,"d":4.78,"text":"字段叫什么、放哪一层？用 explain 问集群。","f":"d2a20a8fa7.mp3","h":"d2a20a8fa7","r":6},{"s":4,"a":5.6,"d":4.58,"text":"加上 dry-run 和 -o yaml，自动生成模板。","f":"bd5b9f8fb4.mp3","h":"bd5b9f8fb4","r":0},{"s":4,"a":10.8,"d":4.39,"text":"client 只在本地渲染，server 走完整校验。","f":"1728fe1d97.mp3","h":"1728fe1d97","r":0},{"s":5,"a":0.6,"d":4.2,"text":"改完文件先别急着 apply，用 diff 看一眼。","f":"83d0ed9cb4.mp3","h":"83d0ed9cb4","r":0},{"s":5,"a":5.6,"d":4.92,"text":"退出码 1 表示有差异，适合放进 CI。","f":"8a155e3b44.mp3","h":"8a155e3b44","r":0},{"s":5,"a":10.8,"d":3.53,"text":"确认无误，再 apply 让集群跟上。","f":"b0fe287a0b.mp3","h":"b0fe287a0b","r":0},{"s":6,"a":0.8,"d":4.68,"text":"小结：一切皆对象，声明式是日常标准。","f":"3b3bece9b6.mp3","h":"3b3bece9b6","r":0},{"s":6,"a":5.6,"d":3.46,"text":"下一课，认识最小调度单元 Pod。","f":"cb5098e835.mp3","h":"cb5098e835","r":0}]
